        "original_id": "cad74d47-f9ab-59ea-862a-f685790cbca2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roger Taylor, Elizabeth Fraser, Robin Guthrie\n- Organizations: Queen, Cocteau Twins, 4AD\n- Products: Head over Heels\n- Roles: musician, singer, songwriter, vocalist\n- Places: Grangemouth, Scotland\n\nFacts:\n- Roger Taylor was born on 26 July 1949 and is an English musician, singer, and songwriter.\n- Elizabeth Fraser was born on 29 August 1963, is also known as Liz Fraser, and is a British singer, songwriter, and musician from Grangemouth, Scotland.\n- Elizabeth Fraser is best known as the vocalist for the band Cocteau Twins.\n- Head over Heels was released in October 1983 by 4AD.\n- Head over Heels was the first Cocteau Twins album made as a duo of Elizabeth Fraser and Robin Guthrie.",
